STATEMENT OF CHANGES (Apache-2.0 §4(b))
---------------------------------------

These files have been MODIFIED from their upstream form. fabius bundles them as
a reference corpus, not as a redistribution of the upstream projects, and the
changes are naming-level rather than functional:

  * Directory names, file names and documentation prose were rewritten to
    fabius's own naming, so text and paths here will not match upstream.
  * Some in-code identifiers and repository URLs were rewritten by the same
    pass. A consequence worth stating plainly: some rewritten URLs and package
    names no longer resolve upstream — treat every link and install command in
    this corpus as unverified, and prefer the upstream project for anything you
    intend to run.
  * Upstream copyright notices and Apache-2.0 license headers are retained in
    the source files wherever they were present; none were deliberately removed.

Nothing here is relicensed. This material keeps its upstream Apache-2.0 terms in
both directions — fabius's own license does not extend to it, and its license
does not extend to fabius. For anything you intend to USE rather than read, go
to the upstream project.
